Sval: an extension off for a page shows off there and does nothing

An extension the user turned off for the selected tab's page, by its
site's switch, the default for every site or the tab's Workspace, keeps
its button greyed and disabled there, and its button, shortcut and menu
item trigger nothing (isShownForTab), and its tooltip says so. Only a
web page is on a site: an extension's own page is never held off.

